---
import { Badge, Card, CardContent, CardDescription, CardHeader, CardTitle, Link, Stack } from '@santi020k/lumen-astro'

import DocsPageHero from '../../../components/DocsPageHero.astro'
import DocsLayout from '../../../layouts/DocsLayout.astro'
---

<DocsLayout
  description="Upgrade between Lumen major versions with verified API changes, dependency updates, and rollback guidance."
  title="Migration guides - Lumen UI"
>
  <Stack gap="section">
    <DocsPageHero
      compact
      description="Start with your installed version. Review the changes, update dependencies together, and verify the application before shipping."
      eyebrow="Migration guides"
      title="Upgrade Lumen with a clear path."
    />
    <Card>
      <CardHeader>
        <CardTitle as="h2">Lumen 2 → Lumen 3</CardTitle>
        <CardDescription>Update package versions and review exhaustive Swift icon switches. Existing component calls remain available.</CardDescription>
      </CardHeader>
      <CardContent><Link href="/docs/migrations/v2-to-v3">Read the v2 → v3 guide</Link></CardContent>
    </Card>
    <Card>
      <CardHeader>
        <Badge class="w-fit" variant="outline">Unpublished candidate</Badge>
        <CardTitle as="h2">Lumen 3 → Lumen 4</CardTitle>
        <CardDescription>Review spacing, focus behavior, dates, charts, and native signatures. V4 is still a local release candidate.</CardDescription>
      </CardHeader>
      <CardContent><Link href="/docs/migrations/v3-to-v4">Read the v3 → v4 guide</Link></CardContent>
    </Card>
    <p>For a v2 application targeting v4, complete and verify both steps in order. Each guide includes consumer checks and a rollback path.</p>
    <Link href="/changelog">Browse the release history</Link>
  </Stack>
</DocsLayout>
